/-!
# Membership of the thirty local Held representatives

Each nonidentity local row is identified with its original witness word in
the corresponding literal local generating pair. Equality in the concrete
Held carrier is detected on the certified four-point base; the four images
are checked by ordinary kernel reduction. The second family checks
`alignment * representative j * alignment⁻¹`, as required by the comap
defining `alignedOvergroup true`. Word evaluation then gives membership.

Source: `../source/representatives.json` and its ATLAS conventions, documented
in `../source/README.md`. Generated by `LocalMembership/source/generate.py`;
the generator supplies candidate words, not trusted proofs.
-/

